│   ├── efficientspeech.yaml
│   └── styletts2.yaml
│
├── datasets/
│   ├── fastspeech2.py
│   ├── efficientspeech.py
│   ├── styletts2.py
│   └── styletts2_data/
│       ├── train_list.txt
│       ├── val_list.txt
│       └── OOD_texts.txt
│
├── models/
│   ├── fastspeech2.py
│   ├── efficientspeech.py
│   ├── styletts2.py
│   └── styletts2_modules/
│       ├── models.py
│       ├── losses.py
│       ├── Modules/
│       └── Utils/
│
├── training/
│   ├── fastspeech2.py
│   ├── efficientspeech.py
│   └── styletts2.py
│
├── validation/
│   ├── fastspeech2.py
│   ├── efficientspeech.py
│   └── styletts2.py
│
├── data/
│   └── LJSpeech-1.1/
│       └── wavs/
│
├── outputs/
│
├── requirements.txt
├── .gitignore
└── README.md
```

The main unified components are:

| Directory | Description |
|---|---|
| `models/` | Model implementations |
| `datasets/` | Dataset loading and preprocessing interfaces |
| `configs/` | Model and dataset configurations |
| `training/` | Minimal training pipelines |
